## solution

```js
const linkedPalindrome = (head) => {
  const values = [];
  let current = head;

  while (current !== null) {
    values.push(current.val);
    current = current.next;
  }

  return values.join(',') === values.reverse().join(',');
};
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)

